   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE MAKER'S PRINTED SIZES AND ONE FRONT PHOTOGRAPH. The technical specification (rev 2025-06-25) and the mechanical drawing MPX3-1045 (Rev 2A, June 13, 2017) print the unit size, the outlet pitch and the mounting buttons; the front photograph (9600 x 2000, straight on) gives every position along the strip, read to about 5 mm from the end where the photograph starts. The library draws the PDU STANDING, cord end down, as the photograph's cord end is the bottom when mounted, so a position along the strip is the y of the front view. No vendor file is held; the figures were read by a person and written down. No PX3 3D model or stencil was read."
